&lt;h2 id=&#34;how-to-get-involved&#34;&gt;How To Get Involved
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ArduPilot project is open source and we encourage participation and code contributions: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/contributing.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
