&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an active group of Beta Testers to help us improve our code: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ardupilot.org/dev/docs/release-procedures.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
