    &gt;issues list&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help other users with log analysis in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discuss.ardupilot.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;support forums&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Improve the wiki and chat with other &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.com/channels/ardupilot&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;wiki editors on Discord #documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact the developers on one of the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-contact-us.html&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
